.Ss As a user
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ kldload-estate --table
\&...
  (no answer from: wireguard, kubernetes -- absent here, or unreadable)
  (run as root: a user cannot read WireGuard, and may not see every lease)
.Ed
.Ss Reachability (--probe)
With a throwaway clone started for the purpose; it is not on a mesh, so
.Li MESH
says
.Ql NO :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# kldload-estate --probe --table
  MACHINE                 CLASS           POWER      ADDRESS          MESH   K8S       TARGET
\&...
  es-3386487              clone           running    192.168.122.189  NO     -         yes  ssh ok
\&...
  52 machine(s), 1 targetable by Ansible.
\&...
# (exited 0)
.Ed
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
The findings above are the diagnostics.
A source that did not answer is listed at the end of the table, and in
.Li sources ;
a finding cannot come from a source that did not answer.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kld 1 ,
.Xr kldload-db 8 ,
.Xr kldload-doctor 8 ,
